      577         type-marking.checkMRC
      578         type-marking.checkOwner
      579         type-marking.checkStatusKM
      580         type-marking.checkTracking
      581         type-marking.saleReturn
      582       WITH NO-ROW-MARKERS SEPARATORS SIZE 107 BY 12.42 .
      583   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
      584        B-exit AT ROW 1 COL 1
      585        B-quit AT ROW 1 COL 11
      586        t-edo AT ROW 2 COL 5.75 WIDGET-ID 142
      587        t-edo-NotMark AT ROW 3 COL 5.75 WIDGET-ID 164
